  },
  {
   "id": "t_88b1713e8b0129f9ef3e",
   "sourceHash": "88b1713e8b0129f9ef3e7a3da5162b68638528761dc60fe8509347cbdb0993a1",
   "text": "Kairaliは病院ですか、それともウェルネス施設ですか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'spa' rendered as 'ウェルネス施設' (wellness facility) per the banned-word lock; the question's contrast (hospital vs non-clinical facility) is preserved."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f70c965c78724a4d7817",
   "sourceHash": "f70c965c78724a4d7817c205d2cfc04d7380ea90ada0d80cc29ead54b53b71a8",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Villageは、NABH認定のアーユルヴェーダ病院です。診療は登録アーユルヴェーダ医師が主導し、すべての治療プログラムは医師の診察を経て行われます。ウェルネス施設ではありません。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'spa' rendered as 'ウェルネス施設' (wellness facility) per the banned-word lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5e59dd247ca24e24b0e0",
   "sourceHash": "5e59dd247ca24e24b0e033f39ce24b70078e490c59233c7942f4d565c6e0e4aa",
   "text": "現在の患者様・再来院の患者様はどの番号に連絡すればよいですか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0d102a5e3db122902d95",
   "sourceHash": "0d102a5e3db122902d9520d8877e5f72a67606226d7c18f75cfa4b43476eeaf5",
   "text": "WhatsAppで患者ケアコーディネーターにメッセージをお送りいただくか（",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment followed by a phone number; phrased to wrap the number in parentheses."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_490d1d75705e06deae51",
   "sourceHash": "490d1d75705e06deae5118fa34a55257e103b3e179d167bea292527e5a643524",
   "text": "）、代表番号にお電話ください（",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment between two phone numbers; closes/opens parentheses around them."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e8172e652792021cbd39",
   "sourceHash": "e8172e652792021cbd3954c7f1ed7293a41cb5b2b564ca29930844f7fecb905d",
   "text": "）。適切な医師におつなぎできるよう、患者番号をお知らせください。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f1705c41e748d5e12f5a",
   "sourceHash": "f1705c41e748d5e12f5a5ca6db96c0ecc643715d58d54441443e45a8ce46561c",
   "text": "渡航前に医師と話すことはできますか？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_69ce26ff3af053ff13d6",
   "sourceHash": "69ce26ff3af053ff13d66dd2091420e4a7541b34d43169194520bd6330332958",
   "text": "はい。登録アーユルヴェーダ医師による無料の",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
